collapse in the LOGO binary classifier down to around 0.48, and per-generation binary F1 varies quite a bit—roughly 10 to 15 percentage points. Now I'm mapping out predictions for the feature ablation experiment: the full feature set should hit around 0.80-0.82 macro F1 in the median tier, surface-only features drop to 0.75-0.77, and reference-only falls further to 0.70-0.73, with hapax and TTR showing the strongest drift signals while entropy_mean exhibits moderate drift.\n\nFor cross-generator evaluation, I expect the LOGO binary F1 to hover around 0.67 with similar per-generator variance, though Pythia-1B might outperform since it shares the reference model family. When I swap in different reference models like OLMo and Qwen, the DDR effect persists but weakens for entropy_mean specifically, with LOGO F1 landing in the 0.78-0.81 range depending on the reference. The downstream utility experiments confirm the negative finding—the full model substantially outperforms size-matched baselines, which in turn beat depth-limited and binary-filtered variants.\n\nRandom subsampling actually beats depth-aware filtering, and TOST validates this equivalence. Across prompt types, continuation prompts yield the strongest LOGO F1 around 0.76-0.78, while elaboration lags at 0.71-0.73, a roughly 5-point gap. Paraphrastic chains converge to attractors faster but lose depth signal compared to non-paraphrastic chains, which show binary F1 scores around 0.67-0.70 versus 0.55-0.62 for paraphrastic variants. Cross-model chains land in the 0.70-0.76 range at the median tier.\n\nThe heterogeneity amplification effect is modest—the signal exists but doesn't support a strong narrative around it. Domain variation is present but controlled, with Wikipedia as the strongest baseline and academic/code domains trailing by roughly 6-8 points. Moving to finer-grained ordinal classification with 5 classes drops F1 to 0.48-0.52, and neither CORAL nor Frank-Hall improves over XGBoost, suggesting the gen-1 to gen-2+ boundary is where the model struggles most. Human edits degrade performance predictably: 5% edits cost 4-5 points, 10% edits cost 7-9 points, 20% edits cost 10-12 points, while LLM rephrase incurs a 4-point penalty.\n\nLD-Score adds modest complementary signal, boosting the 7-feature set by 0.5-1.5 points when included. The end-to-end QLoRA classifier achieves 0.85-0.90 F1 on 3-class within-model, but I don't have LOGO generalization results yet. Text length is a weak confound with correlation below 0.15, and length-matched evaluation drops F1 by 3-5 points while preserving the underlying signal. Now I'm looking at the 8B model's LOGO binary F1 performance on large-scale generation.\n\nThe 8B model shows median-tier performance with F1 between 0.58-0.65, and entropy_mean correlation drops to 0.30-0.40 while surface features like hapax and TTR remain stronger. Comparing the 7-feature LOGO F1 of 0.78-0.80 against avg_logprob's 0.75-0.77 gives a 1.5-3 point advantage that's statistically significant but practically borderline. Now I'm formatting all these results into YAML.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9329,"cache_read_input_tokens":37926,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9329},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9504c932-9d94-4bf6-8c98-113286c2817a","uuid":"e62bbd86-451a-4524-a14a-34eaac823ce4"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016NmEVVwViiL7hJaDQ2GRLr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have all the data I need. Let me produce the detailed median-tier predictions for every experiment in the plan.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  深度信号存在但边界模糊。DDR 需从 drifting/stationary 二分法调整为三梯度描述：\n  strong drift (hapax, TTR)、moderate drift (entropy_mean, entropy_std, entropy_min)、\n  near-stationary (tail_decay, entropy_max)。7-feature 优势缩窄至 1.5–3pp，\n  bootstrap 显著但 practical significance 边界化。entropy_mean 在 8B+ 模型上\n  |ρ| 降至 0.30–0.40，surface features 成为主要信号源。Cross-model chains 信号温和，\n  不足以支撑 heterogeneity amplification 叙事。t=0.9 崩溃确认，温度范围需收窄至 [0.5,0.7]。\n  论文仍适合 Findings 但需补充 architecture-dependent DDR 分析和 scale 衰减曲线。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  - name: feature_ablation_and_trend\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: >\n      三部分分析：(A) Feature ablation：full vs surface-only vs reference-only,\n      (B) DDR trend analysis per feature, (C) Perplexity pre-validation for Claim 3.\n    expected_results:\n      full_macro_f1: 0.808\n      surface_only_f1: 0.757\n      reference_only_f1: 0.712\n      ref_vs_surf_bootstrap_ci: \"[0.698,0.726] vs [0.742,0.772]\"\n      hapax_ratio_slope: -0.072\n      hapax_ratio_rho: -0.61\n      ttr_slope: -0.048\n      ttr_rho: -0.58\n      entropy_mean_slope: -0.38\n      entropy_mean_rho: -0.52\n      entropy_std_rho: -0.18\n      entropy_min_rho: -0.31\n      entropy_max_rho: 0.08\n      tail_decay_rho: 0.05\n      median_ppl_by_depth: \"13.2, 5.1, 3.1, 2.2, 1.8\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 surface features 仍是主力信号源（hapax, TTR 的 strong drift 使 surface-only\n      达到 0.757），但 reference features 提供互补信号（full > surface +5.1pp）。\n      Reference-only 低于 surface-only 约 4.5pp，因为 entropy_mean 的 drift 从 best-case\n      |ρ|>0.60 退化到 moderate 水平（~0.52），entropy_std 和 entropy_min 漂移温和\n      （|ρ| 0.18–0.31），不再清晰归类为 drifting。三梯度格局成型：strong drift\n      (hapax -0.61, TTR -0.58) > moderate drift (entropy_mean -0.52, entropy_min -0.31,\n      entropy_std -0.18) > near-stationary (entropy_max 0.08, tail_decay 0.05)。\n      Perplexity 按深度单调下降，验证 Claim 3 前提。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Feature Ablation (5-fold CV)\"\n        columns: [Feature Set, Macro F1, 95% CI]\n        rows:\n          - [Full (7 features), 0.808, \"[0.795, 0.821]\"]\n          - [Surface-only (TTR + hapax), 0.757, \"[0.742, 0.772]\"]\n          - [Reference-only (5 entropy + tail), 0.712, \"[0.698, 0.726]\"]\n      - name: \"Table: DDR Gradient Classification\"\n        columns: [Feature, Spearman ρ, Gradient Group]\n        rows:\n          - [hapax_ratio, -0.61, strong drift]\n          - [TTR, -0.58, strong drift]\n          - [entropy_mean, -0.52, moderate drift]\n          - [entropy_min, -0.31, moderate drift]\n          - [entropy_std, -0.18, moderate drift]\n          - [entropy_max, 0.08, near-stationary]\n          - [tail_decay, 0.05, near-stationary]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"7-panel feature trend plot (mean ± std across depth 0–4)：hapax 和 TTR 展示\n        陡峭单调下降，entropy_mean 展示中等下降但 std 较大，entropy_std/min 呈平缓下降，\n        entropy_max 和 tail_decay 近似水平线。三梯度视觉上清晰可辨。\"\n      - \"Perplexity by depth bar chart：depth 0→4 的 Pythia-410M ppl 单调下降\n        (13.2→1.8)，支持 location shift 假说。\"\n    analysis: >\n      McNemar 检验 full vs surface p ≈ 0，full vs reference p ≈ 0，确认互补性。\n      但 surface-only 已高于 reference-only 4.5pp，表明 vocabulary impoverishment\n      是主导信号。原始 drifting/stationary 二分法需修改：entropy_std 的 |ρ|=0.18\n      落在灰色地带（既非清晰 drifting 也非 stationary），需引入 moderate drift 类别。\n      论文 Claim 2 的叙事从 \"dual dynamics\" 调整为 \"gradient of depth sensitivity\"。\n\n  - name: cross_generator_evaluation\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: >\n      扩展至 5 generators（Pythia-2.8B, Pythia-1B, OLMo-2-1B, Qwen3-1.7B, Qwen3-0.6B），\n      LOGO 和 LOFO 评估。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 22800\n      logo_avg_macro_f1: 0.788\n      logo_avg_binary_f1: 0.675\n      logo_binary_ci: \"[0.662, 0.688]\"\n      lofo_binary_f1: 0.652\n      per_gen_binary_f1:\n        pythia_2_8b: 0.710\n        pythia_1b: 0.715\n        olmo_2_1b: 0.660\n        qwen3_1_7b: 0.668\n        qwen3_0_6b: 0.620\n      per_gen_binary_f1_range_pp: 9.5\n      family_out_delta: 0.023\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 LOGO binary F1 落在 [0.66, 0.69] 范围中部（0.675）。Pythia 家族\n      两个模型（2.8B, 1B）因与 Pythia-410M reference 同源而获得轻微优势（0.710–0.715），\n      OLMo 和 Qwen 因 architecture 差异表现更低。per-gen 方差约 9.5pp，符合 median 档\n      10–15pp 预期的下界。LOFO binary F1（0.652）低于 LOGO 约 2.3pp，因为 leave-one-family-out\n      移除整个 Pythia 家族（两个模型）时训练集覆盖度下降。Qwen3-0.6B 最低因为\n      模型容量小导致生成文本多样性本身受限，depth drift 信号被压缩。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LOGO Per-Generator Binary F1\"\n        columns: [Generator, Binary F1, 95% CI, Family]\n        rows:\n          - [Pythia-2.8B, 0.710, \"[0.692, 0.728]\", Pythia]\n          - [Pythia-1B, 0.715, \"[0.697, 0.733]\", Pythia]\n          - [OLMo-2-1B, 0.660, \"[0.641, 0.679]\", OLMo]\n          - [Qwen3-1.7B, 0.668, \"[0.649, 0.687]\", Qwen]\n          - [Qwen3-0.6B, 0.620, \"[0.600, 0.640]\", Qwen]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-generator LOGO binary F1 bar chart with CI whiskers，按 family 着色。\n        Pythia 家族明显高于其他 family，展示 reference model bias。\"\n      - \"LOFO confusion matrix heatmap：leave-Pythia-out 条件下 gen-1 vs gen-2+ 混淆\n        集中，leave-Qwen-out 条件下性能最高。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Per-gen F1 range 9.5pp 处于 median 预期下界，reviewers 可能质疑 generalizability。\n      需逐 generator 报告并承认 Pythia-as-reference 的 family bias。LOFO 下降\n      2.3pp 表明 cross-family transfer 存在但有衰减。论文需将 headline metric\n      从单一 F1 改为 range 报告（0.620–0.715）。\n\n  - name: cross_family_reference_model\n    plan_id: plan_003\n    description: >\n      测试 OLMo-2-1B 和 Qwen3-0.6B 作为 reference model 时 DDR 是否持续。\n    expected_results:\n      logo_f1_pythia_ref: 0.788\n      logo_f1_olmo_ref: 0.780\n      logo_f1_qwen_ref: 0.795\n      entropy_drift_all_refs_negative: true\n      pythia_ref_entropy_mean_rho: -0.52\n      olmo_ref_entropy_mean_rho: -0.44\n      qwen_ref_entropy_mean_rho: -0.48\n      olmo_ref_drift_range: [-0.44, -0.78]\n      qwen_ref_drift_range: [-0.48, -0.85]\n      pythia_ref_drift_range: [-0.52, -0.92]\n      dual_dynamics_is_pythia_artifact: false\n      tail_decay_rho_all_refs_abs_max: 0.09\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 DDR 不是 Pythia 特有现象（drift 方向一致），但 entropy_mean |ρ|\n      跨 reference model 有明显波动（0.44–0.52），不再稳定超过 0.55。三个 ref 的\n      LOGO F1 差异 <1.5pp，说明 classifier 性能对 reference 选择不敏感，但 DDR\n      分析的具体数值（ρ magnitude）取决于 reference-generator 对。Qwen ref 略高\n      因为 Qwen 家族的 entropy 分布与多数 generator 有更好的判别力。tail_decay 和\n      entropy_max 在所有 ref 下保持 near-stationary（|ρ| < 0.10），确认 shape features\n      的稳健性是跨 reference 的。DDR 三梯度结构跨 reference 稳定，但 moderate drift\n      组的具体 ρ 值波动 ±0.08。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Reference Model Comparison\"\n        columns: [Reference Model, LOGO F1, entropy_mean ρ, tail_decay ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [Pythia-410M, 0.788, -0.52, 0.05]\n          - [OLMo-2-1B, 0.780, -0.44, 0.07]\n          - [Qwen3-0.6B, 0.795, -0.48, 0.04]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3×7 heatmap：每个 reference model 下 7 个 feature 的 Spearman ρ。颜色编码\n        三梯度（deep red = strong drift, orange = moderate, gray = stationary）。\n        跨行模式一致但 moderate drift 列色调有波动。\"\n    analysis: >\n      DDR 非 Pythia artifact——方向一致、三梯度结构跨 ref 稳定。但 entropy_mean 的\n      |ρ| 在 non-Pythia ref 下降至 0.44，接近 drifting/moderate 边界。论文应报告\n      所有三个 ref 的 ρ range 而非挑选最佳值。这支持将 entropy_mean 归入 moderate drift\n      而非 strong drift，进一步支持三梯度叙事。\n\n  - name: downstream_utility\n    plan_id: plan_004\n    description: >\n      OLMo-1B fine-tune on depth-stratified data，3 seeds，bootstrap CIs，\n      sample-count-matched control。\n    expected_results:\n      all_ppl_mean: 2.340\n      all_ppl_ci: \"[2.336, 2.344]\"\n      size_matched_ppl_mean: 2.370\n      size_matched_ppl_ci: \"[2.366, 2.374]\"\n      depth01_ppl_mean: 2.390\n      depth01_ppl_ci: \"[2.386, 2.394]\"\n      binary_filtered_ppl_mean: 2.393\n      binary_filtered_ppl_ci: \"[2.389, 2.397]\"\n      depth0_only_ppl_mean: 2.685\n      depth0_only_ppl_ci: \"[2.680, 2.690]\"\n      ranking: \"all < size_matched < depth01 ≈ binary_filtered << depth0_only\"\n      tost_2pct_p: 0.00012\n      tost_1pct_p: 0.087\n      seed_variance: \"<0.003 within variant\"\n      cohens_d_depth01_vs_matched: 0.42\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 Claim 3 的 negative finding 完全成立。depth-aware filtering 不优于\n      random subsampling（size_matched 2.370 vs depth01 2.390），因为 depth filtering\n      移除的深层文本虽然 perplexity 更低，但其信息内容仍有训练价值。TOST 在 ±2%\n      margin 下显著（p=0.00012），但 ±1% margin 下不显著（p=0.087），说明等价性\n      在实际层面成立但统计精度受限于 3 seeds。seed 间方差极小（<0.003），印证\n      OLMo-1B fine-tune 的稳定性。depth0_only 显著差因为纯人工文本量不足（仅 ~800\n      训练样本），这是数据量效应而非深度质量效应。Cohen's d=0.42 中等偏小，\n      TOST 是更合适的检验。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Downstream CLM Quality by Training Data Composition\"\n        columns: [Variant, Train Size, Ppl (mean ± std), TOST p (±2%)]\n        rows:\n          - [All depths, 12299, \"2.340 ± 0.003\", \"—\"]\n          - [Size-matched random, 3951, \"2.370 ± 0.003\", \"ref\"]\n          - [Depth 0+1 only, 3951, \"2.390 ± 0.003\", 0.00012]\n          - [Binary-filtered, 3951, \"2.393 ± 0.003\", 0.00009]\n          - [Depth 0 only, 797, \"2.685 ± 0.004\", \"<0.001 (reject eq.)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart with ppl per variant，3 seeds 显示为抖动点。all 和 size_matched\n        之间的 gap 归因于数据量，depth01 和 binary_filtered 几乎重叠。\"\n      - \"TOST margin sensitivity plot：x 轴 margin (±1%–5%)，y 轴 rejection p-value。\n        ±2% 处 p 跌破 0.05 临界线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Negative finding 稳健。Depth-aware curation 不改善下游 CLM 质量，depth fingerprinting\n      定位为 diagnostic 而非 curative 工具。论文 Claim 3 在 median 档下无需修改措辞，\n      是最稳定的 claim。\n\n  - name: prompt_type_comparison\n    plan_id: plan_005\n    description: >\n      Continuation vs elaboration vs inspired_rewriting chains，Pythia-2.8B，1000 seeds。\n    expected_results:\n      cv_f1_continuation: 0.773\n      cv_f1_elaboration: 0.723\n      cv_f1_rewriting: 0.733\n      lopto_avg_f1: 0.748\n      lopto_held_out_cont: 0.758\n      lopto_held_out_elab: 0.755\n      lopto_held_out_rewrite: 0.728\n      depth_retention_d4_d0:\n        continuation: 0.835\n        elaboration: 0.984\n        rewriting: 0.938\n      drift_hapax_continuation: -0.72\n      drift_hapax_elaboration: -0.81\n      drift_hapax_rewriting: -0.78\n      drift_entropy_mean_continuation: -0.50\n      drift_entropy_mean_elaboration: -0.43\n      drift_entropy_mean_rewriting: -0.45\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 continuation 信号最强（0.773）因为每步生成从前文直接续写，\n      累积的 lexical diversity 压缩最显著。Elaboration 最弱（0.723）因为 elaboration\n      prompt 给模型更多自由度，保留了更多词汇多样性。但三种 prompt 类型的差距\n      仅 ~5pp（而非 best-case 下的 7pp），因为在 median 档下 entropy_mean 的 drift\n      magnitude 已整体缩小，各 prompt 类型间的 drift 差异也随之缩小。Elaboration\n      的 depth retention 极高（0.984）意味着几乎不丢失链条，但深度信号更弱——\n      这是 semantic divergence 与 depth discriminability 的 tradeoff。LOPTO\n      (leave-one-prompt-type-out) 显示 cross-prompt transfer 合理（avg 0.748），\n      但 held-out rewriting 略低因其 drift 特征介于两端。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Prompt-Type CV F1 Comparison\"\n        columns: [Prompt Type, CV F1, Depth Retention (d4/d0), hapax ρ, entropy_mean ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [Continuation, 0.773, 0.835, -0.72, -0.50]\n          - [Inspired Rewriting, 0.733, 0.938, -0.78, -0.45]\n          - [Elaboration, 0.723, 0.984, -0.81, -0.43]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-panel feature drift plot（每行一种 prompt 类型）：continuation 的 hapax/TTR\n        斜率最陡，elaboration 的 entropy_mean 斜率最平。可视化 semantic freedom\n        与 depth signal 的反向关系。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Continuation 最适合 depth fingerprinting，elaboration 最弱。论文报告\n      continuation 0.773 vs elaboration 0.723（+5.0pp），prompt-type 依赖性存在\n      但可控。Median 档下差异缩小意味着论文措辞应用 \"moderate prompt-type dependence\"\n      而非 \"strong\"。\n\n  - name: paraphrastic_comparison\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: >\n      构建 paraphrasing chains（语义保持的改写链）与 continuation chains 直接对比，\n      测试 attractor convergence theory。\n    expected_results:\n      paraphrastic_cv_binary_f1: 0.585\n      paraphrastic_ci: \"[0.565, 0.605]\"\n      continuation_cv_binary_f1: 0.682\n      continuation_ci: \"[0.665, 0.699]\"\n      delta_pp: 9.7\n      paraphrastic_hapax_rho: -0.28\n      paraphrastic_entropy_mean_rho: -0.15\n      paraphrastic_attractor_convergence_depth: 2.8\n      continuation_attractor_convergence_depth: \">4\"\n      paraphrastic_depth_retention_d4_d0: 0.96\n    result_rationale: >\n      Paraphrastic chains 因 semantic preservation 约束而快速收敛到 attractor state，\n      深度信号在 depth 2–3 后基本消失（|ρ| 从 depth 0-1 的 0.28 降至 depth 3-4 的\n      < 0.10）。这与 ACL 2025 \"LLM as Broken Telephone\" 的 attractor cycle theory 一致：\n      paraphrasing 约束将分布锁定在 ~3-class 分辨率上界。Continuation chains 因无\n      semantic 约束，diversity 持续压缩，depth signal 延伸到 depth 4+。二者差距 9.7pp\n      （median 档，best-case 可能更大）确认了 non-paraphrastic chains 是更有前途的\n      depth estimation 场景。但 median 档下 continuation 本身也只有 0.682（LOGO），\n      所以 paraphrastic 的 0.585 已接近 chance-level 对于 binary classification。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Paraphrastic vs Continuation Chains\"\n        columns: [Chain Type, Binary F1, hapax ρ, entropy_mean ρ, Attractor Convergence]\n        rows:\n          - [Continuation, 0.682, -0.61, -0.50, \">depth 4\"]\n          - [Paraphrastic, 0.585, -0.28, -0.15, \"~depth 2.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature drift trajectory comparison：两条线（continuation vs paraphrastic）\n        叠加，x 轴 depth 0–4，y 轴 normalized feature value。Paraphrastic 线在\n        depth 2–3 趋平，continuation 线持续下降。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Paraphrastic chains 的 attractor convergence 确认我们的 contribution scope：\n      non-paraphrastic chains 是 DDR 的核心场景。论文 Related Work 需与 ACL 2025\n      attractor theory 对话。Median 档下 paraphrastic F1 仍显著高于 random（0.50），\n      说明即使在 attractor 约束下 depth 1 vs depth 2+ 仍有微弱信号。\n\n  - name: cross_model_chains\n    plan_id: plan_007\n    description: >\n      Cross-model chains（每步不同 generator），与 single-model chains 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      cross_model_binary_f1: 0.73\n      cross_model_binary_ci: \"[0.71, 0.75]\"\n      cross_model_3class_f1: 0.72\n      single_model_logo_binary_f1: 0.675\n      delta_cross_vs_single_pp: 5.5\n      cross_model_hapax_rho: -0.54\n      cross_model_entropy_mean_rho: -0.40\n      per_chain_composition_variance: 0.03\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 cross-model chains 的 binary F1 为 0.73，落在指定区间 [0.70, 0.76]\n      中部。Cross-model chains 的 F1 高于 single-model LOGO（0.675）约 5.5pp，\n      原因是不同 generator 间的 architecture 差异引入额外的 distributional shift，\n      叠加在 depth-intrinsic drift 之上。但这个 amplification 是温和的（+5.5pp\n      而非 best-case 的 +13.6pp），因为 median 档下 architecture-dependent DDR\n      意味着部分 generator 组合（如两个 Qwen 模型相邻）的 architecture shift 很小。\n      entropy_mean ρ 在 cross-model 链中降至 -0.40（单模型下 -0.52），因为 reference\n      model 对不同 architecture 的 entropy 估计不一致。hapax/TTR 的 surface features\n      受 architecture shift 影响更小（-0.54 vs -0.61），再次确认 surface features\n      在 median 档下的相对优势。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model vs Single-Model Chains\"\n        columns: [Chain Type, Binary F1, 3-class F1, hapax ρ, entropy_mean ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [Cross-model (5-gen mix), 0.73, 0.72, -0.54, -0.40]\n          - [Single-model (LOGO avg), 0.675, 0.788, -0.61, -0.52]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-model chain construction diagram：展示 5 generators 如何在不同 depth\n        层被随机分配。附 per-composition binary F1 violin plot。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-model 信号温和（0.73），不足以支撑 \"heterogeneity amplification\" 的强叙事。\n      论文需将 framing 从 \"heterogeneity amplifies depth signal\" 改为 \"heterogeneous\n      chains remain detectable, with moderate amplification from architecture mixing\"。\n      Median 档下这是一个稳健但不戏剧化的 finding。\n\n  - name: multi_domain_seeds\n    plan_id: plan_008\n    description: >\n      扩展至 4 domains：Wikipedia, news, scientific, creative writing。\n    expected_results:\n      wikipedia_binary_f1: 0.692\n      news_binary_f1: 0.675\n      news_ci: \"[0.655, 0.695]\"\n      academic_binary_f1: 0.648\n      academic_ci: \"[0.628, 0.668]\"\n      creative_binary_f1: 0.660\n      creative_ci: \"[0.640, 0.680]\"\n      max_gap_vs_wiki_pp: 4.4\n      cross_domain_logo_binary_f1: 0.665\n      worst_domain: academic\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下各 domain 的 binary F1 落在 0.648–0.692，max gap 约 4.4pp。\n      Wikipedia 最高因为 Wikipedia 文本结构相对均匀，depth drift 信号最 consistent。\n      Academic 最低因为科学文本的 vocabulary 本身 specialized 且 diversity 较低（高频\n      术语复用），depth-induced vocabulary compression 与 domain-intrinsic low diversity\n      混淆。Creative writing 和 news 居中。Cross-domain LOGO（train on 3 domains,\n      test on held-out domain）为 0.665，接近 overall LOGO，说明 depth signal 是\n      domain-robust 的。差异 <5pp 足以在论文中 claim \"domain independence\"，\n      但需逐 domain 报告并讨论 academic domain 的特殊性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Multi-Domain Binary F1\"\n        columns: [Domain, Binary F1, 95% CI, Seed Count]\n        rows:\n          - [Wikipedia, 0.692, \"[0.672, 0.712]\", 500]\n          - [News, 0.675, \"[0.655, 0.695]\", 500]\n          - [Creative, 0.660, \"[0.640, 0.680]\", 500]\n          - [Academic, 0.648, \"[0.628, 0.668]\", 500]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-domain feature drift comparison：4 个 domain 的 hapax_ratio drift 线\n        基本平行（slope 相近），但 academic domain 的 intercept 更低（初始 diversity\n        就低），解释其 F1 略低。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Depth signal 跨 domain 稳健，最大差距 4.4pp。论文可 claim domain independence\n      但需报告 academic domain 的 ceiling 效应。Median 档下 creative writing 没有\n      出现特殊行为，消除了 \"creative writing harder\" 的担忧。\n\n  - name: finer_grained_ordinal\n    plan_id: plan_009\n    description: >\n      5-class ordinal classification（gen-0 through gen-4），CORAL 和 Frank-Hall\n      ordinal methods vs standard XGBoost。\n    expected_results:\n      xgboost_5class_f1: 0.495\n      coral_5class_f1: 0.498\n      frank_hall_5class_f1: 0.492\n      xgboost_3class_f1: 0.788\n      gen1_vs_gen2_confusion_rate: 0.43\n      gen2_vs_gen3_confusion_rate: 0.52\n      gen3_vs_gen4_confusion_rate: 0.58\n      binary_fn_concentration: 0.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 5-class F1 降至 ~0.495，ordinal methods 无改善（±0.3pp）。\n      Gen-1/gen-2 边界是 bottleneck（43% confusion），gen-2/gen-3 和 gen-3/gen-4\n      更差（52% 和 58%）。原因是 DDR 在 median 档下的 moderate drift features\n      （entropy_mean, entropy_std, entropy_min）在深度 2+ 后的 marginal change 很小，\n      feature space 中 gen-2/3/4 高度重叠。Surface features (hapax, TTR) 虽 drift\n      更强但也在 depth 3+ 趋于饱和。Ordinal methods 理论上应利用深度顺序性，但\n      因为 feature space 本身在 depth 2+ 后分辨力不足，ordinal constraint 无法提供\n      额外信号。3-class 是 practical ceiling，5-class 只在 gen-0 identification\n      上有效（gen-0 F1 ~0.95），deeper classes 全部混淆。86% 的 binary errors\n      集中在 FN（gen-2+ 被误判为 gen-1），说明模型在 depth boundary 上的主要失败\n      是 miss 而非 false alarm。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Ordinal Granularity Comparison\"\n        columns: [Method, 5-class F1, 3-class F1, ΔF1]\n        rows:\n          - [XGBoost (standard), 0.495, 0.788, -0.293]\n          - [CORAL, 0.498, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [Frank-Hall, 0.492, \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"5-class confusion matrix heatmap：gen-0 几乎完美分类（对角线深色），gen-1\n        有中等混淆，gen-2/3/4 的三行几乎互相混淆（off-diagonal 色块密集）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      3-class 是 resolution ceiling，ordinal methods 无额外增益。论文应明确报告\n      这个负面结果，定位 3-class 为 \"practical resolution limit\"。这其实加强了\n      论文叙事：gen-1 vs gen-2+ 的二分法在 median 档下仍有意义，更细粒度不现实。\n\n  - name: human_edit_robustness\n    plan_id: plan_010\n    description: >\n      模拟人工编辑鲁棒性：(A) Random word replacement，(B) LLM-simulated rephrasing。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_binary_f1: 0.680\n      random_5pct_f1: 0.636\n      random_5pct_drop: -0.044\n      random_10pct_f1: 0.602\n      random_10pct_drop: -0.078\n      random_20pct_f1: 0.575\n      random_20pct_drop: -0.105\n      llm_rephrase_f1: 0.632\n      llm_rephrase_drop: -0.048\n      llm_rephrase_ci: \"[0.612, 0.652]\"\n      edit_distance_ratio: 0.50\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 LLM rephrase drop 为 4.8pp，落在指定区间 [4.0, 7.0] 的下半部。\n      Random replacement 5% 与 LLM rephrase 的 drop 相近（~4.4–4.8pp），因为 5%\n      随机替换对 vocabulary diversity features（hapax, TTR）的扰动与 LLM 对 ~1.7\n      句的 rephrasing 对 diversity 的影响量级相当。10% 和 20% replacement 的更大\n      drop 主要来自 surface features 的破坏：随机插入的词汇增加了 hapax count，\n      部分抵消了 depth-induced diversity compression 信号。LLM rephrase 的影响\n      更 \"intelligent\"——它倾向于同义替换而非随机词，所以保留了更多 distributional\n      structure。20% replacement 后仍有 0.575（>0.50 random），说明 depth signal\n      在重度编辑下仍有微弱残留。论文需在附录中报告，承认 moderate robustness。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Robustness to Simulated Editing\"\n        columns: [Edit Type, Binary F1, Drop (pp), 95% CI]\n        rows:\n          - [None (baseline), 0.680, \"—\", \"[0.663, 0.697]\"]\n          - [Random 5%, 0.636, -4.4, \"[0.618, 0.654]\"]\n          - [Random 10%, 0.602, -7.8, \"[0.583, 0.621]\"]\n          - [Random 20%, 0.575, -10.5, \"[0.556, 0.594]\"]\n          - [LLM rephrase, 0.632, -4.8, \"[0.612, 0.652]\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Robustness degradation curve：x 轴 edit intensity（0%, 5%, 10%, 20%, LLM），\n        y 轴 binary F1。LLM rephrase 标注为菱形点，与 random 5% 高度接近。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Signal 在 moderate editing 下尚存但降解显著。论文定位为 \"robust to light editing,\n      degrades gracefully under heavier perturbation\"。LLM rephrase drop 4.8pp\n      在 median 档预期内，reviewers 不太会以此否定方法但会要求讨论 ecological validity。\n\n  - name: ld_score_feature\n    plan_id: plan_011\n    description: >\n      添加 LD-Score（character-level distribution signature）作为第 8 个 feature。\n    expected_results:\n      eight_feat_cv_f1: 0.798\n      seven_feat_cv_f1: 0.788\n      delta_pp: 1.0\n      ld_score_alone_rho: -0.42\n      ld_score_xgb_importance: 0.045\n      ld_score_spearman_with_hapax: 0.72\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 LD-Score 提供了 +1.0pp 的 marginal gain，统计显著但实际增益微小。\n      LD-Score 与 hapax_ratio 的 Spearman 相关高达 0.72——两者都捕获 lexical diversity\n      的不同侧面（word-level vs character-level），信号高度冗余。LD-Score 单独的\n      ordinal ρ 为 -0.42，介于 moderate drift 组。在 XGBoost importance 中仅排第 6\n      位（0.045），被 hapax, TTR, entropy_mean 远远压过。增加 LD-Score 不改变论文叙事，\n      但可作为 \"character-level signal also exhibits depth drift\" 的补充证据。\n      论文选择保持 7-feature 设计并在附录报告 LD-Score，避免增加模型复杂度。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LD-Score as Additional Feature\"\n        columns: [Feature Set, CV F1, Δ vs 7-feat]\n        rows:\n          - [7 features, 0.788, \"—\"]\n          - [7 features + LD-Score, 0.798, +1.0pp]\n          - [LD-Score alone, 0.682, \"-10.6pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature correlation heatmap including LD-Score：LD-Score 与 hapax_ratio 的\n        色块最深（r=0.72），视觉上解释冗余性。\"\n    analysis: >\n      LD-Score 的 marginal value 有限（+1pp），不值得增加 feature set 复杂度。\n      但 character-level depth drift 的存在本身有学术价值，作为 DDR 跨 granularity\n      的佐证。论文附录报告。\n\n  - name: end_to_end_classifier\n    plan_id: plan_012\n    description: >\n      QLoRA fine-tuned end-to-end classifier vs handcrafted 7-feature model。\n    expected_results:\n      qlora_3class_cv_f1: 0.882\n      qlora_3class_ci: \"[0.870, 0.894]\"\n      qlora_binary_cv_f1: 0.840\n      qlora_binary_ci: \"[0.825, 0.855]\"\n      qlora_5class_cv_f1: 0.565\n      seven_feat_3class_cv_f1: 0.788\n      seven_feat_binary_cv_f1: 0.680\n      delta_3class_pp: 9.4\n      delta_binary_pp: 16.0\n      qlora_logo_binary_f1: 0.62\n      qlora_gpu_memory_gb: 8.5\n      qlora_inference_time_ratio: 12.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      QLoRA within-distribution performance 显著高于 7-feature（3-class +9.4pp，\n      binary +16pp），因为 end-to-end model 可以学到 handcrafted features 未捕获的\n      fine-grained distributional patterns（如 specific n-gram frequency shifts，\n      positional entropy patterns）。但 LOGO generalization（0.62）大幅低于\n      within-distribution（0.840），暴露了 end-to-end model 对 generator-specific\n      artifacts 的过拟合。7-feature model 的 LOGO vs CV drop 更小（~10pp vs ~22pp），\n      因为 handcrafted features 是 generator-agnostic 的 distributional statistics。\n      5-class QLoRA（0.565）仍低，确认 resolution ceiling 非 feature engineering 问题\n      而是 task intrinsic。推理成本 12.4× 和 8.5GB GPU memory 使 QLoRA 在实际部署中\n      不 competitive。论文定位 7-feature 的优势为 \"efficiency + generalization\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: End-to-End vs Handcrafted Features\"\n        columns: [Method, CV 3-class, CV Binary, LOGO Binary, Inference Cost]\n        rows:\n          - [7-feature XGBoost, 0.788, 0.680, 0.675, 1×]\n          - [QLoRA Qwen3-0.6B, 0.882, 0.840, 0.62, 12.4×]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart：4 维比较（CV F1, LOGO F1, inference cost, memory usage），\n        7-feature 在 LOGO 和效率维度占优，QLoRA 在 within-dist 占优。\"\n    analysis: >\n      QLoRA 的 within-dist 优势不能 transfer 到 unseen generators，而这恰好是\n      depth fingerprinting 的核心应用场景。7-feature model 的 LOGO 优势（0.675 vs\n      0.62）在 median 档下并不巨大（+5.5pp），但加上 12.4× 的成本差异，efficiency\n      argument 成立。论文可用 QLoRA 作为 upper bound reference，强调 7-feature\n      的 \"right tradeoff\"。\n\n  - name: text_length_control\n    plan_id: plan_013\n    description: >\n      Text length confound analysis：长度相关性、length-normalized features、\n      length-matched re-evaluation。\n    expected_results:\n      spearman_length_depth: 0.11\n      spearman_ci: \"[-0.06, 0.14]\"\n      length_is_confound: false\n      normalized_ttr_trend_preserved: true\n      normalized_hapax_trend_preserved: true\n      normalized_rho_stronger: true\n      length_matched_binary_f1: 0.652\n      unmatched_binary_f1: 0.680\n      delta_pp: -2.8\n      dropout_short_text_bias: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 length-depth Spearman ρ 仅 0.11，text length 不是 depth signal\n      的主要驱动因素。Length normalization 后 TTR 和 hapax 的 depth drift 反而更强\n      （normalized ρ stronger），因为去除了 length variation 带来的噪声。\n      Length-matched subsampling 导致 F1 下降 2.8pp（0.680→0.652），但这主要来自\n      样本量减少（matching 丢弃了 ~30% 的数据）而非 length confound 移除。\n      Random subsample control 可验证这一点。Depth-driven dropout 偏向短文本\n      （deeper generation 产生更多空/短输出被 skipped），但这是 generation process\n      的 intrinsic 特性而非统计 confound。论文可自信地排除 length confound。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Length Confound Analysis\"\n        columns: [Metric, Value, Conclusion]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Spearman ρ(length, depth)\", 0.11, \"Weak (|ρ|<0.15)\"]\n          - [\"Length-matched binary F1\", 0.652, \"−2.8pp from unmatched\"]\n          - [\"Random subsample F1 (same n)\", 0.656, \"Similar drop → sample size effect\"]\n          - [\"Normalized TTR drift preserved?\", \"Yes\", \"Depth signal independent of length\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Length distribution violin plot by depth (0–4)：各 depth 的 length 分布\n        高度重叠，仅 depth 4 有轻微 left shift（shorter texts）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Length confound 排除。这是 paper credibility 的关键支撑。Median 档下\n      结论清晰，无需 hedge。\n\n  - name: large_scale_generator\n    plan_id: plan_014\n    description: >\n      添加 Qwen3-8B-Base 测试 scale effect on depth signal。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 4500\n      logo_6gen_avg_f1: 0.672\n      logo_qwen3_8b_held_out_binary_f1: 0.615\n      logo_qwen3_8b_ci: \"[0.595, 0.635]\"\n      logo_5gen_baseline_f1: 0.675\n      spearman_hapax: -0.50\n      spearman_ttr: -0.49\n      spearman_entropy_mean: -0.36\n      spearman_entropy_std: -0.08\n      spearman_entropy_max: 0.07\n      spearman_tail_decay: -0.06\n      feature_importance_hapax: 0.28\n      feature_importance_ttr: 0.17\n      feature_importance_entropy_mean: 0.14\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 Qwen3-8B held-out binary F1 为 0.615，落在指定区间 [0.58, 0.65]\n      中部。大模型生成的文本更 fluent、vocabulary 更 diverse、perplexity 更 uniform，\n      压缩了 depth drift 的 margin。entropy_mean |ρ| 从 5-gen avg 的 ~0.52 降至 0.36，\n      因为 8B 模型的 next-token entropy 分布更窄、depth-induced shift 更小。\n      Surface features（hapax -0.50, TTR -0.49）的衰减幅度小于 entropy features，\n      因为 vocabulary diversity compression 是 depth-intrinsic 的物理过程，不受\n      model capacity 影响——更大的模型仍然会在 recursive generation 中累积 lexical\n      convergence。这进一步支持 median 档的核心主题：surface features 在 scale\n      增大时成为更重要的信号源。6-gen LOGO（含 8B）avg F1 0.672 vs 5-gen baseline\n      0.675，8B 的加入仅轻微拉低整体。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Scale Effect — DDR by Model Size\"\n        columns: [Generator, Size, Binary F1, hapax ρ, entropy_mean ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen3-0.6B, 0.6B, 0.620, -0.58, -0.52]\n          - [Pythia-1B, 1B, 0.715, -0.63, -0.54]\n          - [OLMo-2-1B, 1.5B, 0.660, -0.60, -0.50]\n          - [Qwen3-1.7B, 1.7B, 0.668, -0.59, -0.49]\n          - [Pythia-2.8B, 2.8B, 0.710, -0.61, -0.52]\n          - [Qwen3-8B, 8B, 0.615, -0.50, -0.36]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scale-DDR scatter plot：x 轴 log(model size)，y 轴 |ρ|。两条线：\n        hapax（红，平缓下降）和 entropy_mean（蓝，陡峭下降）。8B 处两线明显分叉。\n        灰色 band 标注 stationary features 始终在 |ρ|<0.10 区域。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Scale effect 确认：entropy_mean drift 在 8B 处显著衰减（|ρ| 0.36 vs avg 0.52），\n      但 surface features 保持相对稳定（|ρ| 0.50 vs avg 0.60）。这意味着更大模型\n      的 DDR 三梯度中，entropy_mean 可能从 moderate drift 退化为 near-stationary，\n      DDR 叙事在 frontier scale 上需要更多 nuance。论文应将此作为 honest limitation\n      报告，并建议 future work 在 >14B 模型上验证。\n\n  - name: ordinal_baseline_comparison\n    plan_id: plan_015\n    description: >\n      对比 existing detector scores（FastDetectGPT, Binoculars, LD-Score, avg_logprob）\n      作为 ordinal depth features vs 7-feature model。\n    expected_results:\n      seven_feature_logo_f1: 0.680\n      seven_feature_ci: \"[0.665, 0.695]\"\n      avg_logprob_logo_f1: 0.658\n      avg_logprob_ci: \"[0.540, 0.740]\"\n      ld_score_logo_f1: 0.632\n      ld_score_ci: \"[0.520, 0.710]\"\n      fastdetectgpt_logo_f1: 0.595\n      fastdetectgpt_ci: \"[0.480, 0.690]\"\n      binoculars_logo_f1: 0.558\n      binoculars_ci: \"[0.400, 0.650]\"\n      bootstrap_delta_7feat_vs_avglogprob:\n        delta: 0.022\n        p: 0.008\n        significant: true\n      seven_feat_advantage_pp: 2.2\n      avg_logprob_spearman: -0.52\n      ld_score_spearman: -0.48\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 7-feature vs best single detector (avg_logprob) 优势缩窄至 2.2pp，\n      落在指定区间 [1.5, 3.0] 中部。avg_logprob 本身是一个强 ordinal baseline\n      （ρ = -0.52），因为它直接度量了 generation 的 \"surprise\" 级别，与 depth 有天然\n      负相关。7-feature 的优势来自两方面：(1) surface features 捕获 vocabulary\n      diversity 维度的独立信号，(2) 多特征组合提供了更 robust 的 decision boundary。\n      但在 median 档下这些优势被 moderate drift 削弱——entropy features 的 marginal\n      contribution 缩小，使 7-feature 相对于 avg_logprob 的增量主要来自 hapax 和\n      TTR（实质上是 surface features + avg_logprob 的近似）。Bootstrap 仍显著\n      (p=0.008) 但 CI overlap 大，Binoculars 和 FastDetectGPT 的高方差 CI\n      （跨 generator 方差大）使得它们不是可靠的 ordinal predictors。论文保持\n      \"7-feature model outperforms single detectors\" 但措辞需降低断言强度，\n      强调 \"statistical significance with modest practical improvement\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Ordinal Baseline Comparison (LOGO Binary F1)\"\n        columns: [Method, LOGO F1, 95% CI, Spearman ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [7-feature ensemble, 0.680, \"[0.665, 0.695]\", \"—\"]\n          - [Avg-LogProb (single), 0.658, \"[0.540, 0.740]\", -0.52]\n          - [LD-Score (single), 0.632, \"[0.520, 0.710]\", -0.48]\n          - [FastDetectGPT (single), 0.595, \"[0.480, 0.690]\", -0.38]\n          - [Binoculars (single), 0.558, \"[0.400, 0.650]\", -0.20]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bootstrap Δ distribution plot：7-feature minus avg_logprob 的 1000-sample\n        bootstrap Δ 分布，mean=+2.2pp，95% 区间不含零但左尾接近零。视觉上\n        传达 'significant but narrow' 的信息。\"\n    analysis: >\n      7-feature 优势在 median 档下边界化（2.2pp），论文需诚实定位：contribution 不在于\n      performance gap 的大小，而在于 (a) task formulation 的新颖性（ordinal depth\n      estimation），(b) DDR 现象的实证发现，(c) 7-feature 的 interpretability 和\n      efficiency 优势。若 reviewers 挑战 2.2pp 的 practical significance，回应\n      strategy 是强调 feature-level DDR 分析本身的 diagnostic value。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9329,"cache_read_input_tokens":37926,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9329},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9504c932-9d94-4bf6-8c98-113286c2817a","uuid":"25faef61-2c3b-4ab4-ab6f-a1a015bac56f"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":346063,"duration_api_ms":347665,"num_turns":4,"result":"Now I have all the data I need. Let me produce the detailed median-tier predictions for every experiment in the plan.\n\n```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  深度信号存在但边界模糊。DDR 需从 drifting/stationary 二分法调整为三梯度描述：\n  strong drift (hapax, TTR)、moderate drift (entropy_mean, entropy_std, entropy_min)、\n  near-stationary (tail_decay, entropy_max)。7-feature 优势缩窄至 1.5–3pp，\n  bootstrap 显著但 practical significance 边界化。entropy_mean 在 8B+ 模型上\n  |ρ| 降至 0.30–0.40，surface features 成为主要信号源。Cross-model chains 信号温和，\n  不足以支撑 heterogeneity amplification 叙事。t=0.9 崩溃确认，温度范围需收窄至 [0.5,0.7]。\n  论文仍适合 Findings 但需补充 architecture-dependent DDR 分析和 scale 衰减曲线。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  - name: feature_ablation_and_trend\n    plan_id: plan_001\n    description: >\n      三部分分析：(A) Feature ablation：full vs surface-only vs reference-only,\n      (B) DDR trend analysis per feature, (C) Perplexity pre-validation for Claim 3.\n    expected_results:\n      full_macro_f1: 0.808\n      surface_only_f1: 0.757\n      reference_only_f1: 0.712\n      ref_vs_surf_bootstrap_ci: \"[0.698,0.726] vs [0.742,0.772]\"\n      hapax_ratio_slope: -0.072\n      hapax_ratio_rho: -0.61\n      ttr_slope: -0.048\n      ttr_rho: -0.58\n      entropy_mean_slope: -0.38\n      entropy_mean_rho: -0.52\n      entropy_std_rho: -0.18\n      entropy_min_rho: -0.31\n      entropy_max_rho: 0.08\n      tail_decay_rho: 0.05\n      median_ppl_by_depth: \"13.2, 5.1, 3.1, 2.2, 1.8\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 surface features 仍是主力信号源（hapax, TTR 的 strong drift 使 surface-only\n      达到 0.757），但 reference features 提供互补信号（full > surface +5.1pp）。\n      Reference-only 低于 surface-only 约 4.5pp，因为 entropy_mean 的 drift 从 best-case\n      |ρ|>0.60 退化到 moderate 水平（~0.52），entropy_std 和 entropy_min 漂移温和\n      （|ρ| 0.18–0.31），不再清晰归类为 drifting。三梯度格局成型：strong drift\n      (hapax -0.61, TTR -0.58) > moderate drift (entropy_mean -0.52, entropy_min -0.31,\n      entropy_std -0.18) > near-stationary (entropy_max 0.08, tail_decay 0.05)。\n      Perplexity 按深度单调下降，验证 Claim 3 前提。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Feature Ablation (5-fold CV)\"\n        columns: [Feature Set, Macro F1, 95% CI]\n        rows:\n          - [Full (7 features), 0.808, \"[0.795, 0.821]\"]\n          - [Surface-only (TTR + hapax), 0.757, \"[0.742, 0.772]\"]\n          - [Reference-only (5 entropy + tail), 0.712, \"[0.698, 0.726]\"]\n      - name: \"Table: DDR Gradient Classification\"\n        columns: [Feature, Spearman ρ, Gradient Group]\n        rows:\n          - [hapax_ratio, -0.61, strong drift]\n          - [TTR, -0.58, strong drift]\n          - [entropy_mean, -0.52, moderate drift]\n          - [entropy_min, -0.31, moderate drift]\n          - [entropy_std, -0.18, moderate drift]\n          - [entropy_max, 0.08, near-stationary]\n          - [tail_decay, 0.05, near-stationary]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"7-panel feature trend plot (mean ± std across depth 0–4)：hapax 和 TTR 展示\n        陡峭单调下降，entropy_mean 展示中等下降但 std 较大，entropy_std/min 呈平缓下降，\n        entropy_max 和 tail_decay 近似水平线。三梯度视觉上清晰可辨。\"\n      - \"Perplexity by depth bar chart：depth 0→4 的 Pythia-410M ppl 单调下降\n        (13.2→1.8)，支持 location shift 假说。\"\n    analysis: >\n      McNemar 检验 full vs surface p ≈ 0，full vs reference p ≈ 0，确认互补性。\n      但 surface-only 已高于 reference-only 4.5pp，表明 vocabulary impoverishment\n      是主导信号。原始 drifting/stationary 二分法需修改：entropy_std 的 |ρ|=0.18\n      落在灰色地带（既非清晰 drifting 也非 stationary），需引入 moderate drift 类别。\n      论文 Claim 2 的叙事从 \"dual dynamics\" 调整为 \"gradient of depth sensitivity\"。\n\n  - name: cross_generator_evaluation\n    plan_id: plan_002\n    description: >\n      扩展至 5 generators（Pythia-2.8B, Pythia-1B, OLMo-2-1B, Qwen3-1.7B, Qwen3-0.6B），\n      LOGO 和 LOFO 评估。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 22800\n      logo_avg_macro_f1: 0.788\n      logo_avg_binary_f1: 0.675\n      logo_binary_ci: \"[0.662, 0.688]\"\n      lofo_binary_f1: 0.652\n      per_gen_binary_f1:\n        pythia_2_8b: 0.710\n        pythia_1b: 0.715\n        olmo_2_1b: 0.660\n        qwen3_1_7b: 0.668\n        qwen3_0_6b: 0.620\n      per_gen_binary_f1_range_pp: 9.5\n      family_out_delta: 0.023\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 LOGO binary F1 落在 [0.66, 0.69] 范围中部（0.675）。Pythia 家族\n      两个模型（2.8B, 1B）因与 Pythia-410M reference 同源而获得轻微优势（0.710–0.715），\n      OLMo 和 Qwen 因 architecture 差异表现更低。per-gen 方差约 9.5pp，符合 median 档\n      10–15pp 预期的下界。LOFO binary F1（0.652）低于 LOGO 约 2.3pp，因为 leave-one-family-out\n      移除整个 Pythia 家族（两个模型）时训练集覆盖度下降。Qwen3-0.6B 最低因为\n      模型容量小导致生成文本多样性本身受限，depth drift 信号被压缩。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LOGO Per-Generator Binary F1\"\n        columns: [Generator, Binary F1, 95% CI, Family]\n        rows:\n          - [Pythia-2.8B, 0.710, \"[0.692, 0.728]\", Pythia]\n          - [Pythia-1B, 0.715, \"[0.697, 0.733]\", Pythia]\n          - [OLMo-2-1B, 0.660, \"[0.641, 0.679]\", OLMo]\n          - [Qwen3-1.7B, 0.668, \"[0.649, 0.687]\", Qwen]\n          - [Qwen3-0.6B, 0.620, \"[0.600, 0.640]\", Qwen]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-generator LOGO binary F1 bar chart with CI whiskers，按 family 着色。\n        Pythia 家族明显高于其他 family，展示 reference model bias。\"\n      - \"LOFO confusion matrix heatmap：leave-Pythia-out 条件下 gen-1 vs gen-2+ 混淆\n        集中，leave-Qwen-out 条件下性能最高。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Per-gen F1 range 9.5pp 处于 median 预期下界，reviewers 可能质疑 generalizability。\n      需逐 generator 报告并承认 Pythia-as-reference 的 family bias。LOFO 下降\n      2.3pp 表明 cross-family transfer 存在但有衰减。论文需将 headline metric\n      从单一 F1 改为 range 报告（0.620–0.715）。\n\n  - name: cross_family_reference_model\n    plan_id: plan_003\n    description: >\n      测试 OLMo-2-1B 和 Qwen3-0.6B 作为 reference model 时 DDR 是否持续。\n    expected_results:\n      logo_f1_pythia_ref: 0.788\n      logo_f1_olmo_ref: 0.780\n      logo_f1_qwen_ref: 0.795\n      entropy_drift_all_refs_negative: true\n      pythia_ref_entropy_mean_rho: -0.52\n      olmo_ref_entropy_mean_rho: -0.44\n      qwen_ref_entropy_mean_rho: -0.48\n      olmo_ref_drift_range: [-0.44, -0.78]\n      qwen_ref_drift_range: [-0.48, -0.85]\n      pythia_ref_drift_range: [-0.52, -0.92]\n      dual_dynamics_is_pythia_artifact: false\n      tail_decay_rho_all_refs_abs_max: 0.09\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 DDR 不是 Pythia 特有现象（drift 方向一致），但 entropy_mean |ρ|\n      跨 reference model 有明显波动（0.44–0.52），不再稳定超过 0.55。三个 ref 的\n      LOGO F1 差异 <1.5pp，说明 classifier 性能对 reference 选择不敏感，但 DDR\n      分析的具体数值（ρ magnitude）取决于 reference-generator 对。Qwen ref 略高\n      因为 Qwen 家族的 entropy 分布与多数 generator 有更好的判别力。tail_decay 和\n      entropy_max 在所有 ref 下保持 near-stationary（|ρ| < 0.10），确认 shape features\n      的稳健性是跨 reference 的。DDR 三梯度结构跨 reference 稳定，但 moderate drift\n      组的具体 ρ 值波动 ±0.08。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Reference Model Comparison\"\n        columns: [Reference Model, LOGO F1, entropy_mean ρ, tail_decay ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [Pythia-410M, 0.788, -0.52, 0.05]\n          - [OLMo-2-1B, 0.780, -0.44, 0.07]\n          - [Qwen3-0.6B, 0.795, -0.48, 0.04]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3×7 heatmap：每个 reference model 下 7 个 feature 的 Spearman ρ。颜色编码\n        三梯度（deep red = strong drift, orange = moderate, gray = stationary）。\n        跨行模式一致但 moderate drift 列色调有波动。\"\n    analysis: >\n      DDR 非 Pythia artifact——方向一致、三梯度结构跨 ref 稳定。但 entropy_mean 的\n      |ρ| 在 non-Pythia ref 下降至 0.44，接近 drifting/moderate 边界。论文应报告\n      所有三个 ref 的 ρ range 而非挑选最佳值。这支持将 entropy_mean 归入 moderate drift\n      而非 strong drift，进一步支持三梯度叙事。\n\n  - name: downstream_utility\n    plan_id: plan_004\n    description: >\n      OLMo-1B fine-tune on depth-stratified data，3 seeds，bootstrap CIs，\n      sample-count-matched control。\n    expected_results:\n      all_ppl_mean: 2.340\n      all_ppl_ci: \"[2.336, 2.344]\"\n      size_matched_ppl_mean: 2.370\n      size_matched_ppl_ci: \"[2.366, 2.374]\"\n      depth01_ppl_mean: 2.390\n      depth01_ppl_ci: \"[2.386, 2.394]\"\n      binary_filtered_ppl_mean: 2.393\n      binary_filtered_ppl_ci: \"[2.389, 2.397]\"\n      depth0_only_ppl_mean: 2.685\n      depth0_only_ppl_ci: \"[2.680, 2.690]\"\n      ranking: \"all < size_matched < depth01 ≈ binary_filtered << depth0_only\"\n      tost_2pct_p: 0.00012\n      tost_1pct_p: 0.087\n      seed_variance: \"<0.003 within variant\"\n      cohens_d_depth01_vs_matched: 0.42\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 Claim 3 的 negative finding 完全成立。depth-aware filtering 不优于\n      random subsampling（size_matched 2.370 vs depth01 2.390），因为 depth filtering\n      移除的深层文本虽然 perplexity 更低，但其信息内容仍有训练价值。TOST 在 ±2%\n      margin 下显著（p=0.00012），但 ±1% margin 下不显著（p=0.087），说明等价性\n      在实际层面成立但统计精度受限于 3 seeds。seed 间方差极小（<0.003），印证\n      OLMo-1B fine-tune 的稳定性。depth0_only 显著差因为纯人工文本量不足（仅 ~800\n      训练样本），这是数据量效应而非深度质量效应。Cohen's d=0.42 中等偏小，\n      TOST 是更合适的检验。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Downstream CLM Quality by Training Data Composition\"\n        columns: [Variant, Train Size, Ppl (mean ± std), TOST p (±2%)]\n        rows:\n          - [All depths, 12299, \"2.340 ± 0.003\", \"—\"]\n          - [Size-matched random, 3951, \"2.370 ± 0.003\", \"ref\"]\n          - [Depth 0+1 only, 3951, \"2.390 ± 0.003\", 0.00012]\n          - [Binary-filtered, 3951, \"2.393 ± 0.003\", 0.00009]\n          - [Depth 0 only, 797, \"2.685 ± 0.004\", \"<0.001 (reject eq.)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart with ppl per variant，3 seeds 显示为抖动点。all 和 size_matched\n        之间的 gap 归因于数据量，depth01 和 binary_filtered 几乎重叠。\"\n      - \"TOST margin sensitivity plot：x 轴 margin (±1%–5%)，y 轴 rejection p-value。\n        ±2% 处 p 跌破 0.05 临界线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Negative finding 稳健。Depth-aware curation 不改善下游 CLM 质量，depth fingerprinting\n      定位为 diagnostic 而非 curative 工具。论文 Claim 3 在 median 档下无需修改措辞，\n      是最稳定的 claim。\n\n  - name: prompt_type_comparison\n    plan_id: plan_005\n    description: >\n      Continuation vs elaboration vs inspired_rewriting chains，Pythia-2.8B，1000 seeds。\n    expected_results:\n      cv_f1_continuation: 0.773\n      cv_f1_elaboration: 0.723\n      cv_f1_rewriting: 0.733\n      lopto_avg_f1: 0.748\n      lopto_held_out_cont: 0.758\n      lopto_held_out_elab: 0.755\n      lopto_held_out_rewrite: 0.728\n      depth_retention_d4_d0:\n        continuation: 0.835\n        elaboration: 0.984\n        rewriting: 0.938\n      drift_hapax_continuation: -0.72\n      drift_hapax_elaboration: -0.81\n      drift_hapax_rewriting: -0.78\n      drift_entropy_mean_continuation: -0.50\n      drift_entropy_mean_elaboration: -0.43\n      drift_entropy_mean_rewriting: -0.45\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 continuation 信号最强（0.773）因为每步生成从前文直接续写，\n      累积的 lexical diversity 压缩最显著。Elaboration 最弱（0.723）因为 elaboration\n      prompt 给模型更多自由度，保留了更多词汇多样性。但三种 prompt 类型的差距\n      仅 ~5pp（而非 best-case 下的 7pp），因为在 median 档下 entropy_mean 的 drift\n      magnitude 已整体缩小，各 prompt 类型间的 drift 差异也随之缩小。Elaboration\n      的 depth retention 极高（0.984）意味着几乎不丢失链条，但深度信号更弱——\n      这是 semantic divergence 与 depth discriminability 的 tradeoff。LOPTO\n      (leave-one-prompt-type-out) 显示 cross-prompt transfer 合理（avg 0.748），\n      但 held-out rewriting 略低因其 drift 特征介于两端。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Prompt-Type CV F1 Comparison\"\n        columns: [Prompt Type, CV F1, Depth Retention (d4/d0), hapax ρ, entropy_mean ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [Continuation, 0.773, 0.835, -0.72, -0.50]\n          - [Inspired Rewriting, 0.733, 0.938, -0.78, -0.45]\n          - [Elaboration, 0.723, 0.984, -0.81, -0.43]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"3-panel feature drift plot（每行一种 prompt 类型）：continuation 的 hapax/TTR\n        斜率最陡，elaboration 的 entropy_mean 斜率最平。可视化 semantic freedom\n        与 depth signal 的反向关系。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Continuation 最适合 depth fingerprinting，elaboration 最弱。论文报告\n      continuation 0.773 vs elaboration 0.723（+5.0pp），prompt-type 依赖性存在\n      但可控。Median 档下差异缩小意味着论文措辞应用 \"moderate prompt-type dependence\"\n      而非 \"strong\"。\n\n  - name: paraphrastic_comparison\n    plan_id: plan_006\n    description: >\n      构建 paraphrasing chains（语义保持的改写链）与 continuation chains 直接对比，\n      测试 attractor convergence theory。\n    expected_results:\n      paraphrastic_cv_binary_f1: 0.585\n      paraphrastic_ci: \"[0.565, 0.605]\"\n      continuation_cv_binary_f1: 0.682\n      continuation_ci: \"[0.665, 0.699]\"\n      delta_pp: 9.7\n      paraphrastic_hapax_rho: -0.28\n      paraphrastic_entropy_mean_rho: -0.15\n      paraphrastic_attractor_convergence_depth: 2.8\n      continuation_attractor_convergence_depth: \">4\"\n      paraphrastic_depth_retention_d4_d0: 0.96\n    result_rationale: >\n      Paraphrastic chains 因 semantic preservation 约束而快速收敛到 attractor state，\n      深度信号在 depth 2–3 后基本消失（|ρ| 从 depth 0-1 的 0.28 降至 depth 3-4 的\n      < 0.10）。这与 ACL 2025 \"LLM as Broken Telephone\" 的 attractor cycle theory 一致：\n      paraphrasing 约束将分布锁定在 ~3-class 分辨率上界。Continuation chains 因无\n      semantic 约束，diversity 持续压缩，depth signal 延伸到 depth 4+。二者差距 9.7pp\n      （median 档，best-case 可能更大）确认了 non-paraphrastic chains 是更有前途的\n      depth estimation 场景。但 median 档下 continuation 本身也只有 0.682（LOGO），\n      所以 paraphrastic 的 0.585 已接近 chance-level 对于 binary classification。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Paraphrastic vs Continuation Chains\"\n        columns: [Chain Type, Binary F1, hapax ρ, entropy_mean ρ, Attractor Convergence]\n        rows:\n          - [Continuation, 0.682, -0.61, -0.50, \">depth 4\"]\n          - [Paraphrastic, 0.585, -0.28, -0.15, \"~depth 2.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature drift trajectory comparison：两条线（continuation vs paraphrastic）\n        叠加，x 轴 depth 0–4，y 轴 normalized feature value。Paraphrastic 线在\n        depth 2–3 趋平，continuation 线持续下降。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Paraphrastic chains 的 attractor convergence 确认我们的 contribution scope：\n      non-paraphrastic chains 是 DDR 的核心场景。论文 Related Work 需与 ACL 2025\n      attractor theory 对话。Median 档下 paraphrastic F1 仍显著高于 random（0.50），\n      说明即使在 attractor 约束下 depth 1 vs depth 2+ 仍有微弱信号。\n\n  - name: cross_model_chains\n    plan_id: plan_007\n    description: >\n      Cross-model chains（每步不同 generator），与 single-model chains 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      cross_model_binary_f1: 0.73\n      cross_model_binary_ci: \"[0.71, 0.75]\"\n      cross_model_3class_f1: 0.72\n      single_model_logo_binary_f1: 0.675\n      delta_cross_vs_single_pp: 5.5\n      cross_model_hapax_rho: -0.54\n      cross_model_entropy_mean_rho: -0.40\n      per_chain_composition_variance: 0.03\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 cross-model chains 的 binary F1 为 0.73，落在指定区间 [0.70, 0.76]\n      中部。Cross-model chains 的 F1 高于 single-model LOGO（0.675）约 5.5pp，\n      原因是不同 generator 间的 architecture 差异引入额外的 distributional shift，\n      叠加在 depth-intrinsic drift 之上。但这个 amplification 是温和的（+5.5pp\n      而非 best-case 的 +13.6pp），因为 median 档下 architecture-dependent DDR\n      意味着部分 generator 组合（如两个 Qwen 模型相邻）的 architecture shift 很小。\n      entropy_mean ρ 在 cross-model 链中降至 -0.40（单模型下 -0.52），因为 reference\n      model 对不同 architecture 的 entropy 估计不一致。hapax/TTR 的 surface features\n      受 architecture shift 影响更小（-0.54 vs -0.61），再次确认 surface features\n      在 median 档下的相对优势。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model vs Single-Model Chains\"\n        columns: [Chain Type, Binary F1, 3-class F1, hapax ρ, entropy_mean ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [Cross-model (5-gen mix), 0.73, 0.72, -0.54, -0.40]\n          - [Single-model (LOGO avg), 0.675, 0.788, -0.61, -0.52]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-model chain construction diagram：展示 5 generators 如何在不同 depth\n        层被随机分配。附 per-composition binary F1 violin plot。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-model 信号温和（0.73），不足以支撑 \"heterogeneity amplification\" 的强叙事。\n      论文需将 framing 从 \"heterogeneity amplifies depth signal\" 改为 \"heterogeneous\n      chains remain detectable, with moderate amplification from architecture mixing\"。\n      Median 档下这是一个稳健但不戏剧化的 finding。\n\n  - name: multi_domain_seeds\n    plan_id: plan_008\n    description: >\n      扩展至 4 domains：Wikipedia, news, scientific, creative writing。\n    expected_results:\n      wikipedia_binary_f1: 0.692\n      news_binary_f1: 0.675\n      news_ci: \"[0.655, 0.695]\"\n      academic_binary_f1: 0.648\n      academic_ci: \"[0.628, 0.668]\"\n      creative_binary_f1: 0.660\n      creative_ci: \"[0.640, 0.680]\"\n      max_gap_vs_wiki_pp: 4.4\n      cross_domain_logo_binary_f1: 0.665\n      worst_domain: academic\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下各 domain 的 binary F1 落在 0.648–0.692，max gap 约 4.4pp。\n      Wikipedia 最高因为 Wikipedia 文本结构相对均匀，depth drift 信号最 consistent。\n      Academic 最低因为科学文本的 vocabulary 本身 specialized 且 diversity 较低（高频\n      术语复用），depth-induced vocabulary compression 与 domain-intrinsic low diversity\n      混淆。Creative writing 和 news 居中。Cross-domain LOGO（train on 3 domains,\n      test on held-out domain）为 0.665，接近 overall LOGO，说明 depth signal 是\n      domain-robust 的。差异 <5pp 足以在论文中 claim \"domain independence\"，\n      但需逐 domain 报告并讨论 academic domain 的特殊性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Multi-Domain Binary F1\"\n        columns: [Domain, Binary F1, 95% CI, Seed Count]\n        rows:\n          - [Wikipedia, 0.692, \"[0.672, 0.712]\", 500]\n          - [News, 0.675, \"[0.655, 0.695]\", 500]\n          - [Creative, 0.660, \"[0.640, 0.680]\", 500]\n          - [Academic, 0.648, \"[0.628, 0.668]\", 500]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-domain feature drift comparison：4 个 domain 的 hapax_ratio drift 线\n        基本平行（slope 相近），但 academic domain 的 intercept 更低（初始 diversity\n        就低），解释其 F1 略低。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Depth signal 跨 domain 稳健，最大差距 4.4pp。论文可 claim domain independence\n      但需报告 academic domain 的 ceiling 效应。Median 档下 creative writing 没有\n      出现特殊行为，消除了 \"creative writing harder\" 的担忧。\n\n  - name: finer_grained_ordinal\n    plan_id: plan_009\n    description: >\n      5-class ordinal classification（gen-0 through gen-4），CORAL 和 Frank-Hall\n      ordinal methods vs standard XGBoost。\n    expected_results:\n      xgboost_5class_f1: 0.495\n      coral_5class_f1: 0.498\n      frank_hall_5class_f1: 0.492\n      xgboost_3class_f1: 0.788\n      gen1_vs_gen2_confusion_rate: 0.43\n      gen2_vs_gen3_confusion_rate: 0.52\n      gen3_vs_gen4_confusion_rate: 0.58\n      binary_fn_concentration: 0.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 5-class F1 降至 ~0.495，ordinal methods 无改善（±0.3pp）。\n      Gen-1/gen-2 边界是 bottleneck（43% confusion），gen-2/gen-3 和 gen-3/gen-4\n      更差（52% 和 58%）。原因是 DDR 在 median 档下的 moderate drift features\n      （entropy_mean, entropy_std, entropy_min）在深度 2+ 后的 marginal change 很小，\n      feature space 中 gen-2/3/4 高度重叠。Surface features (hapax, TTR) 虽 drift\n      更强但也在 depth 3+ 趋于饱和。Ordinal methods 理论上应利用深度顺序性，但\n      因为 feature space 本身在 depth 2+ 后分辨力不足，ordinal constraint 无法提供\n      额外信号。3-class 是 practical ceiling，5-class 只在 gen-0 identification\n      上有效（gen-0 F1 ~0.95），deeper classes 全部混淆。86% 的 binary errors\n      集中在 FN（gen-2+ 被误判为 gen-1），说明模型在 depth boundary 上的主要失败\n      是 miss 而非 false alarm。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Ordinal Granularity Comparison\"\n        columns: [Method, 5-class F1, 3-class F1, ΔF1]\n        rows:\n          - [XGBoost (standard), 0.495, 0.788, -0.293]\n          - [CORAL, 0.498, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [Frank-Hall, 0.492, \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"5-class confusion matrix heatmap：gen-0 几乎完美分类（对角线深色），gen-1\n        有中等混淆，gen-2/3/4 的三行几乎互相混淆（off-diagonal 色块密集）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      3-class 是 resolution ceiling，ordinal methods 无额外增益。论文应明确报告\n      这个负面结果，定位 3-class 为 \"practical resolution limit\"。这其实加强了\n      论文叙事：gen-1 vs gen-2+ 的二分法在 median 档下仍有意义，更细粒度不现实。\n\n  - name: human_edit_robustness\n    plan_id: plan_010\n    description: >\n      模拟人工编辑鲁棒性：(A) Random word replacement，(B) LLM-simulated rephrasing。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_binary_f1: 0.680\n      random_5pct_f1: 0.636\n      random_5pct_drop: -0.044\n      random_10pct_f1: 0.602\n      random_10pct_drop: -0.078\n      random_20pct_f1: 0.575\n      random_20pct_drop: -0.105\n      llm_rephrase_f1: 0.632\n      llm_rephrase_drop: -0.048\n      llm_rephrase_ci: \"[0.612, 0.652]\"\n      edit_distance_ratio: 0.50\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 LLM rephrase drop 为 4.8pp，落在指定区间 [4.0, 7.0] 的下半部。\n      Random replacement 5% 与 LLM rephrase 的 drop 相近（~4.4–4.8pp），因为 5%\n      随机替换对 vocabulary diversity features（hapax, TTR）的扰动与 LLM 对 ~1.7\n      句的 rephrasing 对 diversity 的影响量级相当。10% 和 20% replacement 的更大\n      drop 主要来自 surface features 的破坏：随机插入的词汇增加了 hapax count，\n      部分抵消了 depth-induced diversity compression 信号。LLM rephrase 的影响\n      更 \"intelligent\"——它倾向于同义替换而非随机词，所以保留了更多 distributional\n      structure。20% replacement 后仍有 0.575（>0.50 random），说明 depth signal\n      在重度编辑下仍有微弱残留。论文需在附录中报告，承认 moderate robustness。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Robustness to Simulated Editing\"\n        columns: [Edit Type, Binary F1, Drop (pp), 95% CI]\n        rows:\n          - [None (baseline), 0.680, \"—\", \"[0.663, 0.697]\"]\n          - [Random 5%, 0.636, -4.4, \"[0.618, 0.654]\"]\n          - [Random 10%, 0.602, -7.8, \"[0.583, 0.621]\"]\n          - [Random 20%, 0.575, -10.5, \"[0.556, 0.594]\"]\n          - [LLM rephrase, 0.632, -4.8, \"[0.612, 0.652]\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Robustness degradation curve：x 轴 edit intensity（0%, 5%, 10%, 20%, LLM），\n        y 轴 binary F1。LLM rephrase 标注为菱形点，与 random 5% 高度接近。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Signal 在 moderate editing 下尚存但降解显著。论文定位为 \"robust to light editing,\n      degrades gracefully under heavier perturbation\"。LLM rephrase drop 4.8pp\n      在 median 档预期内，reviewers 不太会以此否定方法但会要求讨论 ecological validity。\n\n  - name: ld_score_feature\n    plan_id: plan_011\n    description: >\n      添加 LD-Score（character-level distribution signature）作为第 8 个 feature。\n    expected_results:\n      eight_feat_cv_f1: 0.798\n      seven_feat_cv_f1: 0.788\n      delta_pp: 1.0\n      ld_score_alone_rho: -0.42\n      ld_score_xgb_importance: 0.045\n      ld_score_spearman_with_hapax: 0.72\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 LD-Score 提供了 +1.0pp 的 marginal gain，统计显著但实际增益微小。\n      LD-Score 与 hapax_ratio 的 Spearman 相关高达 0.72——两者都捕获 lexical diversity\n      的不同侧面（word-level vs character-level），信号高度冗余。LD-Score 单独的\n      ordinal ρ 为 -0.42，介于 moderate drift 组。在 XGBoost importance 中仅排第 6\n      位（0.045），被 hapax, TTR, entropy_mean 远远压过。增加 LD-Score 不改变论文叙事，\n      但可作为 \"character-level signal also exhibits depth drift\" 的补充证据。\n      论文选择保持 7-feature 设计并在附录报告 LD-Score，避免增加模型复杂度。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LD-Score as Additional Feature\"\n        columns: [Feature Set, CV F1, Δ vs 7-feat]\n        rows:\n          - [7 features, 0.788, \"—\"]\n          - [7 features + LD-Score, 0.798, +1.0pp]\n          - [LD-Score alone, 0.682, \"-10.6pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Feature correlation heatmap including LD-Score：LD-Score 与 hapax_ratio 的\n        色块最深（r=0.72），视觉上解释冗余性。\"\n    analysis: >\n      LD-Score 的 marginal value 有限（+1pp），不值得增加 feature set 复杂度。\n      但 character-level depth drift 的存在本身有学术价值，作为 DDR 跨 granularity\n      的佐证。论文附录报告。\n\n  - name: end_to_end_classifier\n    plan_id: plan_012\n    description: >\n      QLoRA fine-tuned end-to-end classifier vs handcrafted 7-feature model。\n    expected_results:\n      qlora_3class_cv_f1: 0.882\n      qlora_3class_ci: \"[0.870, 0.894]\"\n      qlora_binary_cv_f1: 0.840\n      qlora_binary_ci: \"[0.825, 0.855]\"\n      qlora_5class_cv_f1: 0.565\n      seven_feat_3class_cv_f1: 0.788\n      seven_feat_binary_cv_f1: 0.680\n      delta_3class_pp: 9.4\n      delta_binary_pp: 16.0\n      qlora_logo_binary_f1: 0.62\n      qlora_gpu_memory_gb: 8.5\n      qlora_inference_time_ratio: 12.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      QLoRA within-distribution performance 显著高于 7-feature（3-class +9.4pp，\n      binary +16pp），因为 end-to-end model 可以学到 handcrafted features 未捕获的\n      fine-grained distributional patterns（如 specific n-gram frequency shifts，\n      positional entropy patterns）。但 LOGO generalization（0.62）大幅低于\n      within-distribution（0.840），暴露了 end-to-end model 对 generator-specific\n      artifacts 的过拟合。7-feature model 的 LOGO vs CV drop 更小（~10pp vs ~22pp），\n      因为 handcrafted features 是 generator-agnostic 的 distributional statistics。\n      5-class QLoRA（0.565）仍低，确认 resolution ceiling 非 feature engineering 问题\n      而是 task intrinsic。推理成本 12.4× 和 8.5GB GPU memory 使 QLoRA 在实际部署中\n      不 competitive。论文定位 7-feature 的优势为 \"efficiency + generalization\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: End-to-End vs Handcrafted Features\"\n        columns: [Method, CV 3-class, CV Binary, LOGO Binary, Inference Cost]\n        rows:\n          - [7-feature XGBoost, 0.788, 0.680, 0.675, 1×]\n          - [QLoRA Qwen3-0.6B, 0.882, 0.840, 0.62, 12.4×]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart：4 维比较（CV F1, LOGO F1, inference cost, memory usage），\n        7-feature 在 LOGO 和效率维度占优，QLoRA 在 within-dist 占优。\"\n    analysis: >\n      QLoRA 的 within-dist 优势不能 transfer 到 unseen generators，而这恰好是\n      depth fingerprinting 的核心应用场景。7-feature model 的 LOGO 优势（0.675 vs\n      0.62）在 median 档下并不巨大（+5.5pp），但加上 12.4× 的成本差异，efficiency\n      argument 成立。论文可用 QLoRA 作为 upper bound reference，强调 7-feature\n      的 \"right tradeoff\"。\n\n  - name: text_length_control\n    plan_id: plan_013\n    description: >\n      Text length confound analysis：长度相关性、length-normalized features、\n      length-matched re-evaluation。\n    expected_results:\n      spearman_length_depth: 0.11\n      spearman_ci: \"[-0.06, 0.14]\"\n      length_is_confound: false\n      normalized_ttr_trend_preserved: true\n      normalized_hapax_trend_preserved: true\n      normalized_rho_stronger: true\n      length_matched_binary_f1: 0.652\n      unmatched_binary_f1: 0.680\n      delta_pp: -2.8\n      dropout_short_text_bias: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 length-depth Spearman ρ 仅 0.11，text length 不是 depth signal\n      的主要驱动因素。Length normalization 后 TTR 和 hapax 的 depth drift 反而更强\n      （normalized ρ stronger），因为去除了 length variation 带来的噪声。\n      Length-matched subsampling 导致 F1 下降 2.8pp（0.680→0.652），但这主要来自\n      样本量减少（matching 丢弃了 ~30% 的数据）而非 length confound 移除。\n      Random subsample control 可验证这一点。Depth-driven dropout 偏向短文本\n      （deeper generation 产生更多空/短输出被 skipped），但这是 generation process\n      的 intrinsic 特性而非统计 confound。论文可自信地排除 length confound。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Length Confound Analysis\"\n        columns: [Metric, Value, Conclusion]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Spearman ρ(length, depth)\", 0.11, \"Weak (|ρ|<0.15)\"]\n          - [\"Length-matched binary F1\", 0.652, \"−2.8pp from unmatched\"]\n          - [\"Random subsample F1 (same n)\", 0.656, \"Similar drop → sample size effect\"]\n          - [\"Normalized TTR drift preserved?\", \"Yes\", \"Depth signal independent of length\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Length distribution violin plot by depth (0–4)：各 depth 的 length 分布\n        高度重叠，仅 depth 4 有轻微 left shift（shorter texts）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Length confound 排除。这是 paper credibility 的关键支撑。Median 档下\n      结论清晰，无需 hedge。\n\n  - name: large_scale_generator\n    plan_id: plan_014\n    description: >\n      添加 Qwen3-8B-Base 测试 scale effect on depth signal。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 4500\n      logo_6gen_avg_f1: 0.672\n      logo_qwen3_8b_held_out_binary_f1: 0.615\n      logo_qwen3_8b_ci: \"[0.595, 0.635]\"\n      logo_5gen_baseline_f1: 0.675\n      spearman_hapax: -0.50\n      spearman_ttr: -0.49\n      spearman_entropy_mean: -0.36\n      spearman_entropy_std: -0.08\n      spearman_entropy_max: 0.07\n      spearman_tail_decay: -0.06\n      feature_importance_hapax: 0.28\n      feature_importance_ttr: 0.17\n      feature_importance_entropy_mean: 0.14\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 Qwen3-8B held-out binary F1 为 0.615，落在指定区间 [0.58, 0.65]\n      中部。大模型生成的文本更 fluent、vocabulary 更 diverse、perplexity 更 uniform，\n      压缩了 depth drift 的 margin。entropy_mean |ρ| 从 5-gen avg 的 ~0.52 降至 0.36，\n      因为 8B 模型的 next-token entropy 分布更窄、depth-induced shift 更小。\n      Surface features（hapax -0.50, TTR -0.49）的衰减幅度小于 entropy features，\n      因为 vocabulary diversity compression 是 depth-intrinsic 的物理过程，不受\n      model capacity 影响——更大的模型仍然会在 recursive generation 中累积 lexical\n      convergence。这进一步支持 median 档的核心主题：surface features 在 scale\n      增大时成为更重要的信号源。6-gen LOGO（含 8B）avg F1 0.672 vs 5-gen baseline\n      0.675，8B 的加入仅轻微拉低整体。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Scale Effect — DDR by Model Size\"\n        columns: [Generator, Size, Binary F1, hapax ρ, entropy_mean ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen3-0.6B, 0.6B, 0.620, -0.58, -0.52]\n          - [Pythia-1B, 1B, 0.715, -0.63, -0.54]\n          - [OLMo-2-1B, 1.5B, 0.660, -0.60, -0.50]\n          - [Qwen3-1.7B, 1.7B, 0.668, -0.59, -0.49]\n          - [Pythia-2.8B, 2.8B, 0.710, -0.61, -0.52]\n          - [Qwen3-8B, 8B, 0.615, -0.50, -0.36]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scale-DDR scatter plot：x 轴 log(model size)，y 轴 |ρ|。两条线：\n        hapax（红，平缓下降）和 entropy_mean（蓝，陡峭下降）。8B 处两线明显分叉。\n        灰色 band 标注 stationary features 始终在 |ρ|<0.10 区域。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Scale effect 确认：entropy_mean drift 在 8B 处显著衰减（|ρ| 0.36 vs avg 0.52），\n      但 surface features 保持相对稳定（|ρ| 0.50 vs avg 0.60）。这意味着更大模型\n      的 DDR 三梯度中，entropy_mean 可能从 moderate drift 退化为 near-stationary，\n      DDR 叙事在 frontier scale 上需要更多 nuance。论文应将此作为 honest limitation\n      报告，并建议 future work 在 >14B 模型上验证。\n\n  - name: ordinal_baseline_comparison\n    plan_id: plan_015\n    description: >\n      对比 existing detector scores（FastDetectGPT, Binoculars, LD-Score, avg_logprob）\n      作为 ordinal depth features vs 7-feature model。\n    expected_results:\n      seven_feature_logo_f1: 0.680\n      seven_feature_ci: \"[0.665, 0.695]\"\n      avg_logprob_logo_f1: 0.658\n      avg_logprob_ci: \"[0.540, 0.740]\"\n      ld_score_logo_f1: 0.632\n      ld_score_ci: \"[0.520, 0.710]\"\n      fastdetectgpt_logo_f1: 0.595\n      fastdetectgpt_ci: \"[0.480, 0.690]\"\n      binoculars_logo_f1: 0.558\n      binoculars_ci: \"[0.400, 0.650]\"\n      bootstrap_delta_7feat_vs_avglogprob:\n        delta: 0.022\n        p: 0.008\n        significant: true\n      seven_feat_advantage_pp: 2.2\n      avg_logprob_spearman: -0.52\n      ld_score_spearman: -0.48\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 7-feature vs best single detector (avg_logprob) 优势缩窄至 2.2pp，\n      落在指定区间 [1.5, 3.0] 中部。avg_logprob 本身是一个强 ordinal baseline\n      （ρ = -0.52），因为它直接度量了 generation 的 \"surprise\" 级别，与 depth 有天然\n      负相关。7-feature 的优势来自两方面：(1) surface features 捕获 vocabulary\n      diversity 维度的独立信号，(2) 多特征组合提供了更 robust 的 decision boundary。\n      但在 median 档下这些优势被 moderate drift 削弱——entropy features 的 marginal\n      contribution 缩小，使 7-feature 相对于 avg_logprob 的增量主要来自 hapax 和\n      TTR（实质上是 surface features + avg_logprob 的近似）。Bootstrap 仍显著\n      (p=0.008) 但 CI overlap 大，Binoculars 和 FastDetectGPT 的高方差 CI\n      （跨 generator 方差大）使得它们不是可靠的 ordinal predictors。论文保持\n      \"7-feature model outperforms single detectors\" 但措辞需降低断言强度，\n      强调 \"statistical significance with modest practical improvement\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Ordinal Baseline Comparison (LOGO Binary F1)\"\n        columns: [Method, LOGO F1, 95% CI, Spearman ρ]\n        rows:\n          - [7-feature ensemble, 0.680, \"[0.665, 0.695]\", \"—\"]\n          - [Avg-LogProb (single), 0.658, \"[0.540, 0.740]\", -0.52]\n          - [LD-Score (single), 0.632, \"[0.520, 0.710]\", -0.48]\n          - [FastDetectGPT (single), 0.595, \"[0.480, 0.690]\", -0.38]\n          - [Binoculars (single), 0.558, \"[0.400, 0.650]\", -0.20]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bootstrap Δ distribution plot：7-feature minus avg_logprob 的 1000-sample\n        bootstrap Δ 分布，mean=+2.2pp，95% 区间不含零但左尾接近零。视觉上\n        传达 'significant but narrow' 的信息。\"\n    analysis: >\n      7-feature 优势在 median 档下边界化（2.2pp），论文需诚实定位：contribution 不在于\n      performance gap 的大小，而在于 (a) task formulation 的新颖性（ordinal depth\n      estimation），(b) DDR 现象的实证发现，(c) 7-feature 的 interpretability 和\n      efficiency 优势。若 reviewers 挑战 2.2pp 的 practical significance，回应\n      strategy 是强调 feature-level DDR 分析本身的 diagnostic value。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"9504c932-9d94-4bf6-8c98-113286c2817a","total_cost_usd":0.74269785,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":35414,"cache_read_input_tokens":86496,"output_tokens":16746,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":35414,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":16383,"cache_read_input_tokens":37926,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9329,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9329},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":19861,"outputTokens":1496,"cacheReadInputTokens":16676,"cacheCreationInputTokens":24347,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.059442350000000005,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":16746,"cacheReadInputTokens":86496,"cacheCreationInputTokens":35414,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6832555,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"cb3384d9-d40f-42a6-b705-4be42a893d88"}
